- \ref laplace::bijector::scalar_bijector::inverse_distance_upper "inverse_distance_upper()" — Distance of \ref laplace::bijector::scalar_bijector::inverse "inverse()" to \ref laplace::bijector::scalar_bijector::forward_domain_upper "forward_domain_upper()".
